# Go
/cmd/replichai/replichai
/cmd/server/server

# Frontend build + deps (the build is embedded at image-build time; a
# committed dist/PLACEHOLDER keeps the go:embed non-empty without a build).
# Everything the build writes is ignored by default rather than named one
# artifact at a time — naming them meant each new static file (a favicon, a
# social card) arrived untracked and one `git add` away from being committed.
/frontend/node_modules/
/internal/spa/dist/*
!/internal/spa/dist/PLACEHOLDER

# Scratch
*.tfplan

# Secrets and local artifacts (never commit .env — it holds deployment secrets)
.env
.coverage
*.tsbuildinfo

# Python reference caches
__pycache__/
/replichai
coverage.out

# Generated by lateregate on every `make lint-config`; never committed.
.golangci.yml

# Agent instructions live in AGENTS.md; CLAUDE.md is a local symlink to it.
CLAUDE.md
